mutter-independent-workspaces packages and builds patches written by others,
plus its own patches on top of them.

The 0000 patches in patches/ come from these merge requests:

  GNOME/mutter!5194
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/mutter/-/merge_requests/5194

  GNOME/gnome-shell!4299
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-shell/-/merge_requests/4299

by Victor C. (vicajilau), based on earlier work by Chris Willingham
(GNOME/mutter!4864, GNOME/gnome-shell!4049).

